OL,4,BWatford sack boss Dionisi after 18     
OL,5,Bgames                                  
OL,6,GWatford are looking for their sixth    
OL,7,Gmanager in 18 months after they sacked 
OL,8,Ghead coach Alessio Dionisi following   
OL,9,G18 games in charge.                    
OL,11,FThe 46-year-old Italian was appointed  
OL,12,Fin June after the departure of Ed      
OL,13,FStill, who himself lasted only three   
OL,14,Fmonths at Vicarage Road.               
OL,16,FStill, Javi Gracia and Paulo Pezzolano 
OL,17,Fwere all also given full-time          
OL,18,Fcontracts after Tom Cleverley left in  
OL,19,FMay 2025.                              
